<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="webs https://github.com/cnmoseman/htb-study-trackers/issues/new?template=report-problem.yml&amp;cert=CWPE&amp;where=Prep+notes&amp;title=%5BProblem%5D+%5BCWPE%5D+" foreground="#f05517">Report a problem</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
