<node name="06 - Attack Chain" unique_id="203" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwpe exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>The path from first foothold to full compromise. Feeds the report's </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Network Compromise Walkthrough</rich_text>
<rich_text>. Only the steps on the path go here; everything else stays a standalone finding.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#f05517">High-Level Steps</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>1. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Cracked the corporate network key and joined the Wi-Fi</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>2. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Logged in to the router panel with a default password</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#f05517">Access Gained</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">one row per step above, so you can see where each jump came from</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#f05517">Detailed Steps</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">reproduction steps, with links to the host notes and the commands you ran</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>1. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Captured a handshake, cracked it, then connected as a client</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
